**Why:** `TaskType` is static reference/lookup data read on many page loads (dropdowns / pick-lists). On Cosmos every read is metered as RU — uncached reference reads drove `orbit-geo` to ~28k RU during testing. On the old VM MongoDB these were absorbed for free from the RAM working set.

Part of the **Database Structure Effort** (MongoDB → CosmosDB migration).

---

## Recommended implementation — pick ONE scheme

Both wrap `TaskType`'s existing `FetchActive()` / `FetchAll()` read and invalidate on `Save()`. Cache key per scheme: `TaskType.Active` (add a `TaskType.All` key too if both reads are used).

### Option A — .NET `IMemoryCache` (in-process)  ⟵ recommended for this data

```csharp
